/E (The city of Fort Payne is no different than a large business and should be operated like a business. The Alabama League of Municipalities explains that the mayor of a city serves as the head of the executive branch and is responsible for overseeing the day-to-day operations of the city. The mayor is charged with the general supervision and control of municipal departments, programs and facilities. The mayor performs many of the same functions as a CEO of a private corporation. If elected I will provide the leadership that is critically needed to bring financial stability, responsible decision-making, and vital progress to Fort Payne.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
